:: Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Bath Widgets [widget]
<<widget 'deadwood-reblooms-kylar-bathroom-link'>>
  <<if $kylar_sleep_abduction is 1 and $KylarExpansion.stay_invited>>
    <<bathroomicon 'bath'>><<lanLink '浴室 (0:01)' 'Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bathroom'>><<pass 1>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bathroom []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'kylarmanor'>><<effects>>
<<if !$KylarExpansion.stay_invited>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You leave the closed bathroom door alone.' '你没有擅自推开紧闭的浴室门。'>>
<<else>>
  <<if $KylarExpansion.bathDay isnot Time.days and Time.hour gte 18 and Time.hour lt 23
    and C.npc.Kylar.state is 'active'
    and (!maplebirch.get('VanillaPlus') or !maplebirch.get("VanillaPlus").realEstate.residenceOf('Kylar'))>>
    <<set $KylarExpansion.bathDay to Time.days>>
    <<set $KylarExpansion.bathEncounter to C.npc.Kylar.state is 'active'
      and (Time.hour gte 18 or getKylarLocation().area is 'manor_bedroom')
      and (!maplebirch.get('VanillaPlus') or !maplebirch.get("VanillaPlus").realEstate.residenceOf('Kylar'))
      and random(1, 2) is 1>>
  <</if>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>The manor bathroom sits off the front hall. The old pipes knock faintly behind the wall, and someone has left a folded towel on the shelf outside the door.
    <<option 'CN'>>庄园浴室就在门厅旁。旧水管在墙后轻轻作响，门外的搁板上有人留了一条叠好的毛巾。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<if $KylarExpansion.bathDay is Time.days and $KylarExpansion.bathEncounter
    and C.npc.Kylar.state is 'active'
    and (Time.hour gte 18 or getKylarLocation().area is 'manor_bedroom')
    and (!maplebirch.get('VanillaPlus') or !maplebirch.get("VanillaPlus").realEstate.residenceOf('Kylar'))>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Water is already running. Kylar calls your name from behind the closed door.' '里面已经响起水声。凯拉尔隔着紧闭的门叫了你的名字。'>><br><br>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink '回应凯拉尔' 'Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Meeting'>><</lanLink>><br>
    <<bathroomicon 'bath'>><<lanLink '等凯拉尔洗完再洗 (0:40)' 'Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Wash'>><<pass 40>><<strip>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<else>>
    <<bathroomicon 'bath'>><<lanLink '独自洗浴 (0:20)' 'Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Wash'>><<pass 20>><<strip>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br><<getouticon>><<lanLink '返回门厅' 'Manor Hall'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Wash []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'kylarmanor'>><<effects>><<wash>>
<<set $KylarExpansion.bathEncounter to false>>
<<lanSwitch 'The pipes rattle as you wash, but the water stays warm. You dry yourself and put your clothes back on.' '你洗浴时水管仍在轻响，水却一直很暖。你擦干身体，重新穿好衣服。'>><<clotheson>>
<br><br><<getouticon>><<lanLink '返回门厅' 'Manor Hall'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Meeting []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'kylarmanor'>><<effects>>
<<if !$KylarExpansion.stay_invited or $KylarExpansion.bathDay isnot Time.days
  or !$KylarExpansion.bathEncounter
  or C.npc.Kylar.state isnot 'active'
  or (maplebirch.get('VanillaPlus') and maplebirch.get("VanillaPlus").realEstate.residenceOf('Kylar'))>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Kylar has finished bathing and gone back to the bedroom.' '凯拉尔已经洗完，回到房间去了。'>>
<<else>>
  <<npc Kylar>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>Kylar opens the door a crack after you answer. <<He>> had heard you enter the hall and wondered whether the pipes had frightened you. "They make that noise every time," <<he>> says. A towel is draped around <<his>> shoulders.
    <<option 'CN'>>你应声后，凯拉尔才把门打开一条缝。<<He>>听见你走进门厅，担心水管的响声吓到了你。“它每次都会这样。”<<he>>说，肩上披着毛巾。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<socialiseicon>><<lanLink '告诉凯拉尔你没事' 'Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Reassure'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<if isLoveInterest('Kylar')>>
    <<loveicon 'kiss'>><<lanLink '问凯拉尔能否留下' 'Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Together'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br><<getouticon>><<lanLink '让凯拉尔继续洗浴' 'Manor Hall'>><<set $KylarExpansion.bathEncounter to false>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Reassure []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'kylarmanor'>><<effects>>
<<if $KylarExpansion.stay_invited and $KylarExpansion.bathDay is Time.days
  and $KylarExpansion.bathEncounter and C.npc.Kylar.state is 'active'
  and (!maplebirch.get('VanillaPlus') or !maplebirch.get("VanillaPlus").realEstate.residenceOf('Kylar'))>>
  <<set $KylarExpansion.bathEncounter to false>>
  <<npc Kylar>><<person1>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You tell Kylar the pipes did not frighten you. <<He>> relaxes, then points out the dry towel left for you. "Use it if you want to bathe later."' '你告诉凯拉尔，水管的声音没有吓到你。<<He>>松了口气，指了指留给你的干毛巾。“你待会儿想洗的话，可以用它。”'>>
  <<npcincr Kylar love 1>><<glove>>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You have already said what you came to say.' '你想说的话已经说过了。'>>
<</if>>
<br><br><<getouticon>><<lanLink '返回门厅' 'Manor Hall'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Together []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'kylarmanor'>><<effects>>
<<npc Kylar>><<person1>>
<<if !$KylarExpansion.stay_invited or !isLoveInterest('Kylar')
  or $KylarExpansion.bathDay isnot Time.days or !$KylarExpansion.bathEncounter
  or C.npc.Kylar.state isnot 'active'
  or (maplebirch.get('VanillaPlus') and maplebirch.get("VanillaPlus").realEstate.residenceOf('Kylar'))>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You have already finished here. There is nothing more to do.' '你已经收拾好了。这里没有别的事可做。'>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>You ask whether Kylar wants you to stay. <<if C.npc.Kylar.rage gte 50>> <<He>> keeps hold of the door frame and does not step aside. "You only just got here. You are not going anywhere yet." <<He>> waits for your answer without letting go.<<else>> <<He>> blinks, then steps aside to make room. "If— if you want to," <<he>> says. <<He>> waits for your answer, looking at you rather than away.<</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>你问凯拉尔是否愿意让你留下。<<if C.npc.Kylar.rage gte 50>> <<He>>抓着门框，没有让开。“你才刚来。哪儿也别想去。”<<He>>等着你回答，手也没有松开。<<else>> <<He>>愣了一下，随后挪开身体。“你、你想的话。”<<he>>说。<<He>>看着你，没有再移开视线，等你回答。<</if>>
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <span class='lewd'><<lanSwitch 'Kylar watches you undress, then looks away too late.' '凯拉尔看着你脱衣，想移开视线时已经太迟。'>></span><br>
  <<bathroomicon 'bath'>><<lanLink '一起洗浴 (0:20)' 'Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Together Wash'>><<pass 20>><<strip>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<loveicon 'kiss'>><<lanLink '吻凯拉尔' 'Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Intimacy'>><<set $sexstart to 1>><<strip>><</lanLink>><<promiscuous1>><<kissvirginitywarning>><<NPCvirginitywarning 'Kylar' 'kiss'>><br>
<</if>>
<br><br><<getouticon>><<lanLink '到此为止' 'Manor Hall'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Together Wash []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'kylarmanor'>><<effects>>
<<set $KylarExpansion.bathEncounter to false>>
<<npc Kylar>><<person1>><<wash>>
<<lanSwitch 'Kylar makes room for you by the tap and steadies the loose shower head while you wash. <span class="lewd">He keeps finding excuses to touch you — a hand at your shoulder, at your hip — and each time <<he>> catches himself and looks away, hard against <<his>> own thigh.</span> When you finish, <<he>> offers you the towel <<he>> set aside.' '凯拉尔在水龙头旁为你腾出地方。你洗浴时，<<he>>帮你扶着松动的淋浴喷头。<span class="lewd"><<He>>不断找借口碰你——手搭上你的肩，又滑到腰侧——每次<<he>>都忽然惊醒，别开脸，却已经硬得贴着自己的大腿。</span>洗完后，<<he>>递来先前为你留的毛巾。'>>
<<npcincr Kylar love 1>><<glove>><<stress -3>><<lstress>><<clotheson>>
<br><br><<getouticon>><<lanLink '返回门厅' 'Manor Hall'>><</lanLink>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Intimacy []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'kylarmanor'>>
<<if $sexstart is 1>>
  <<clearnpc>><<npc Kylar>>
<</if>>
<<person1>>
<<if $sexstart is 1>>
  <<set $sexstart to 0>>
  <<consensual>><<set $consensual to 1>><<neutral 1>><<maninit>><<npcexpose>>
  <<set $enemytrust += 100>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>Kylar asks again if you mean to stay. When you kiss <<him>>, <<he>> folds the towel out of the water's reach, and the heat of <<his>> skin presses against your thigh before <<he>> can think better of it. <span class='lewd'>Water laps between you as <<he>> fits <<his>> hips to yours, already stiff and failing to hide it.</span> <<if C.npc.Kylar.rage gte 50>><span class='teal'>"Tell me if I'm too close,"</span><<else>>"I— I can stop,"<</if>> <<he>> says, and then adds, much too quickly: "Not that I want to. Unless you do. Sorry." <<He>> waits for your answer, watching your face, one hand already closed around your waist.
    <<option 'CN'>>凯拉尔又问了一遍，你是否真的想留下。你吻过来，<<he>>才把毛巾叠好，放到水溅不到的地方，<<his>>皮肤的热度已经贴上了你的大腿，等<<he>>想收回来时已经太晚。<span class='lewd'>水在你们之间晃开，<<he>>把腰贴了上来，硬得藏都藏不住。</span><<if C.npc.Kylar.rage gte 50>><span class='teal'>“靠得太近就告诉我。”</span><<else>>“我、我可以停。”<</if>><<he>>说，又急急忙忙补上一句：“不是我想停。除非你想。对不起。”<<He>>盯着你的脸，等你回答，一只手已经圈上了你的腰。
  <</language>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<set $enemyanger to -10>>
<<effects>><<effectsman>><<man>><<stateman>>
<br><br><<actionsman>>
<<if _combatend>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink '继续' 'Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Intimacy Finish'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink '继续' 'Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Intimacy'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Kylar Manor Bath Intimacy Finish []
<<set $outside to 0>><<location 'kylarmanor'>><<effects>>
<<set $KylarExpansion.bathEncounter to false>>
<<person1>>
<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
  <<ejaculation>><<npcincr Kylar lust -20>><<lllust>><<npcincr Kylar love 1>><<glove>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Kylar stays pressed against you while <<his>> breathing slows, and does not pull away from the mess between you. When the water begins to cool, <<he>> finds the towel and asks whether you are comfortable, still flushed from what <<he>> just did.' '凯拉尔贴着你不肯动，呼吸慢慢平下来，也没有躲开你们之间那片狼藉。水渐渐凉了，<<he>>才拿起毛巾，红着脸问你还好吗。'>>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
  <<npcincr Kylar love -2>><<llove>>
  <<lanSwitch 'Kylar recoils and asks you to stop. You step back and give <<him>> room to leave.' '凯拉尔退开，请你停下。你让出空间，等<<he>>先离开。'>>
<<else>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You stop. Kylar passes you a towel and waits while you catch your breath.' '你停了下来。凯拉尔把毛巾递给你，等你平复呼吸。'>>
<</if>>
<<wash>><<clotheson>><<endcombat>><<npc Kylar>><<person1>>
<br><br><<getouticon>><<lanLink '返回门厅' 'Manor Hall'>><</lanLink>>
